{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30929","headline":"发蕙风馆遇阴不见九华山有作 · 孟迟","name":"发蕙风馆遇阴不见九华山有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我来淮阴城，千江万山无不经。\n山青水碧千万丈，奇峯急派何纵横。\n又闻九华山，山顶连青冥。\n太白有逸韵，使我西南行。\n一步一攀策，前行正鸡鸣。\n阴云冉冉忽飞起，千里万里危峥嵘。\n譬如天之有日蚀，使我昏沈犹不明。\n人家敲镜救不得，光阴却属贪狼星。\n恨亦不能通，言亦不足听。\n长鞭挥马出门去，是以九华爲不平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟迟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}